				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "Sw/3WmTuQ/a2YAGkVBRg3Q=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Tactical-Tools includes a simple opt-in namespacing scheme with three objectives.\n1. Allow for classes to know their namespace and print themselves with glamor.\n2. Provide a universal mechanism for selecting capabilities based upon class naming conventions.\n3. Offer potential for improved organisation, classes grouped into a genuinely useful namespaces in an unobtrusive manner."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-19T16:22:59.229466+01:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-19T16:36:32.838414+01:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "MzEFh37rT2+Okq8Xvwe1tw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "# Pretty printing\nMarvelous as GT is, it does have some rough points that most users are happy to work around and tolerate for the greater good. One of these is that having accepted that the number of classes is considerable, we settle for universally clunky naming conventions.\n\nThis scheme fixes both of these with minimal effort, one class side method `#isNamespaced` is all that is needed. Excellent news for environments  like `Cuis` that do not support Traits."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-19T16:35:24.887881+01:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-19T18:14:38.986057+01:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "2LZ6br05SYCg9ApWSsSAZQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Implementation - annotation\n{{gtMethod:TTClientAbstract class>>isNamespaced}}  uses the pragma {{gtPragma:namespaced:}} (in preference to   {{gtPragma:namespaced}}) to annotate the class heirarchy.\n\n{{gtMethod:TTNamespaces class>>sizerFromPragma:forName:}} is the core of this implementation demonstrating the options available for the annotation.\n\na. String - specifies the exact prefix\nb. Integer - specifies the size of the prefix\nc. Symbol - specifies a method that calculates the prefix size, and separator size.\nd. Character - specifies a character to be used as the delimeter."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-19T18:06:24.59072+01:00"
					}
