					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-08-19T18:15:10.524087+01:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "ZVX6s61HSuWmogOkuFTwDg=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "## Implementation - presentation\nThe class {{gtClass:Hub}} provides a central point as an interface to global system behaviour, that enables Tactical-Tools to be portable to other Smalltalk environments. Routing our presentation methods via the Hub provides the opportunity to customise the implmeneation behind Namespacing for each environment e.g. {{gtClass:PharoˆHub}} vs {{gtClass:CuisˆHub}}, and {{gtClass:GlamorousˆHub}}\n the method {{gtMethod:Hub class>>pretty:}} being a good example."
			},
